            "created_at": "2025-08-26T15:29:50.026553+00:00",
            "notes": "For the last Round and Power i suggest 2 very different options,\n\nFirst: [CounterMeasures](item_1a15e568-079c-4d1f-a7e5-37219bd9b87f).\n\nWhy? Because now you can swap out  [Mastermind\u2019s Mitigator](item_ed05519f-24f7-456a-8a3a-cdc145a7250d) and instead play with  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) for more  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and  [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) to spam your missiles on cooldown.\n\n [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) is also a viable option.\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\nSecond:  [Party Protector](item_1ef9061d-cfa4-4f4e-a262-ab1012438e69) \n\nWhy? You are basically spamming your Ult and with that you and your allies will get a ton of Overhealth since it also scales with  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power). This is a great survivability option imo. \n\n\nNote: If you want to swap out  [Mastermind\u2019s Mitigator](item_ed05519f-24f7-456a-8a3a-cdc145a7250d) here, i would definitely go with  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) \n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe other Powers i listed are viable as well if you don want to think too much",
